मुख्य स्क्रीनें (User flow + Screens)

1) Splash Screen (2–3s)

लोगो सेंटर में (MENMARK LOGO)

नीचे छोटा टैगलाइन: "Buy Smart. Sell Easy."

बैकग्राउंड सफेद, ऊपर yellow बार स्लिम


2) Onboarding / Intro (optional)

2–3 कार्ड्स: Fast delivery, Secure payment, Return policy

Skip बटन Right-top


3) Authentication

Login (Mobile / Email + OTP)

Sign Up (Name, Mobile, Email)

Forgot Password


4) Home Screen (मुख्य)

Top header (Yellow bar): Left: menu/hamburger, Center: logo/title, Right: cart icon with badge और search icon

Below header: Search bar (placeholder: "Search products, brands...")

Categories horizontal scroll: Men, Women, Electronics, Accessories, Shoes, Watches, New, Offers

Banner carousel (full width) — promotional banners (swipe)

Flash Deals / Today offers — horizontal cards with timer

Product Grid / List — 2-column grid cards


Product Card (grid item)

Image (HD)

Title (short)

Price (bold) + MRP (strike) + discount %

Rating stars + reviews count

Below: two side-by-side buttons (small): Add to Cart (outline) and Buy Now (filled yellow)

Quick wishlist heart icon top-right of image


5) Product Detail Page

Large product image carousel (swipe, pinch zoom)

Title, ratings, reviews

Size/Color selectors (if applicable)

Price, offers, delivery estimate

Buttons fixed at bottom: Add to Cart (left) and Buy Now (right — big yellow)

Product description, specifications, reviews, seller info


6) Cart Screen

List of selected products with qty stepper, price calculation

Promo code input

Bottom summary: Subtotal, Delivery charges, Total

Checkout button (big yellow)


7) Checkout Flow

Address selection / Add New Address

Shipping options

Payment method: UPI / Cards / Netbanking / Wallet / COD

Order confirmation screen with order id + ETA + Track Order button


8) Order Tracking

Timeline view (Ordered → Packed → Shipped → Out for delivery → Delivered)

Map preview (if available)

Contact seller / support button


9) Profile / Account

Orders, Returns & Refunds, Wallet, Saved Addresses, Payment Methods, Coupons, Settings, Logout


10) Wishlist, Notifications, Offers

Wishlist list, push-notifications center, coupon listing



