---

Admin Panel (Web dashboard) — features for seller / admin

(डेवलपर को दिए जाने लायक स्पेसिफिकेशन)

A) Authentication & Roles

Super Admin, Admin, Seller, Support


B) Dashboard

Quick KPIs: Total sales (day/week/month), Orders pending, Active users, Revenue

Graphs: Sales trend, Top categories, Top products


C) Products Management (CRUD)

Add product: Title, Description, Category, Subcategory, SKU, Price, MRP, Stock quantity, Images (multi), Variants (size/color), Weight/Dimensions, Return policy

Bulk upload via CSV

Edit / Disable product


D) Orders Management

View orders, update status (Packed/Shipped/Delivered/Returned), print invoice, assign tracking ID


E) Users Management

View users, block/unblock, KYC status (if needed)


F) Coupons & Offers

Create coupon codes, % or flat discount, validity, usage limits


G) Payments & Settlements

View transactions, payouts to sellers, refunds


H) Content & Banners

Manage homepage banners, category banners, promotional popups


I) Support / Chat

View & respond to user tickets


J) Settings

Tax settings, shipping rates, return policy text, payment gateway config (Razorpay / UPI / Paytm)



