Quick Implementation Notes for Dev

1. Frontend: React Native (recommended) or Flutter


2. Backend: Node.js + Express or Firebase (Realt-time orders + storage)


3. Database: MongoDB / Firestore


4. Payment Gateway: Razorpay / UPI integration — ensure PCI compliance for cards


5. Cloud Storage: AWS S3 / Firebase Storage for product images
